# Bot runtime logs -- written by the live action server on every turn
# (llm_refusal_log.jsonl / unresolved_log.jsonl / neo4j_error_log.jsonl, see
# how_it_works.md's logging table), not source code. These were committed
# early on by accident and keep changing on every bot run -- see the note at
# the bottom of this file about untracking them.
Chatbot/bot/actions/*_log.jsonl

