# tools for claude

conersation.md
PROJECT_CONTEXT.md
how_it_works.md
Graphing/misc/
# Graphing/kb/ itself is NOT ignored -- build_kb.py, kb/tuning/'s hand-authored
# files (entity_resolution.json, relation_phrases.json, review_decisions.json,
# definitions.json), kb/curation/'s audit/review .py scripts (and their .md/.jsonl
# artifacts), and README.md/methodology.md are real source, not scratch, and were
# never meant to be unversioned (found 2026-09-18 while fixing the ngaben-tier KB
# gap -- entity_resolution.json is the only record of every KB curation decision
# CLAUDE.md documents, e.g. the Panca Maha Bhuta broader_overrides fix). kb/'s
# output/, tuning/, curation/ split dates from 2026-09-22 (the flat kb/ folder
# had become hard to read with build scripts, tuning config, and generated
# artifacts all sitting side by side).
#
# Of build_kb.py's generated outputs (kb/output/), only the ones nothing at
# runtime actually reads stay ignored here -- pure reports/docs, safe to always
# regenerate (2026-09-21 audit: confirmed via grep, only referenced in a
# comment, never loaded by code):
Graphing/kb/output/glossary.md
Graphing/kb/output/review_queue.jsonl
Graphing/kb/output/build_report.txt
# entities.json/relations.jsonl (read directly by Graphing/neo4/load_ngaben_to_neo4j.py)
# and facts.jsonl/passages.jsonl (read directly by Chatbot/bot/kb_content.py, at bot
# runtime, not just at Neo4j-load time) are NOT ignored -- a fresh clone needs them to
# actually run the loader/bot without first re-running build_kb.py, and they're the
# tangible output of 8 batches of graph-fix curation, worth keeping as a checked-in
# snapshot rather than relying purely on regeneration.
Graphing/auditTooling/
Graphing/_archive/
Graphing/kgImg/

# NOTE (2026-09-17 gitignore audit, resolved 2026-09-18): a .gitignore entry only
# stops FUTURE adds -- it never removes a file git is already tracking on its own.
# This previously flagged 6 files that were committed despite being covered by a
# pattern above; all 6 are now resolved (approved as part of a broader 2026-09-18
# cleanup pass, not done silently):
#   - `conersation.md` and 4 files under `Graphing/misc/` (relation_audit_report.md,
#     RELATION_AUDIT_RUNBOOK.md, flag.txt, knowledge-graph-cleanup-plan.md) --
#     untracked via `git rm --cached` (kept on disk; still gitignored going forward).
#     (Of those 4, only flag.txt is still on disk as of 2026-09-22 -- the other 3
#     were fully consumed/superseded and deleted outright in that day's cleanup pass.)
#   - `Chatbot/bot/actions/llm_refusal_log.jsonl` / `unresolved_log.jsonl` (bot
#     runtime logs, regenerated every run) -- same, untracked via `git rm --cached`.
#   - `Chatbot/bot/tests/test_stories.yml` (tested an intent taxonomy the bot no
#     longer has, per how_it_works.md §6/§7) -- deleted outright, not just untracked;
#     the bot currently has no automated test coverage as a result (see how_it_works.md
#     §6 for the standing follow-up work this leaves).
